   "subject": "Re: .html plotGoogleMap does not load in shiny App when deployed on shinyapps.io",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><div>\n            <p>Someone on the shinyapps Forum solved my issue. <code>http</code> needs to be replaced by <code>https</code> in the map file.\nCodewise, this means that:</p>\n\n<pre><span style=\"background-color:rgb(204,204,204)\"><code><span>readLines</span><span>(</span><span>&#39;myMap1.html&#39;</span><span>)</span></code></span></pre>\n\n<br><p>needs to be replaced by</p>\n\n<pre><code><span style=\"background-color:rgb(204,204,204)\"><span>gsub</span><span>(</span><span>&quot;<a href=\"http://maps.google.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://maps.google.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792403470048000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3qYEJ6fDQgPv8ybuAFQ3pq\">http://maps.google.com/</a>&quot;</span><span>,</span><span> \n     </span><span>&quot;<a href=\"https://maps.google.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://maps.google.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792403470048000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0tQRDgYuWWsC44jI10R43p\">https://maps.google.com/</a>&quot;</span><span>,</span><span> \n     readLines</span><span>(</span><span>&#39;myMap1.html&#39;</span><span>),</span><span> \n     fixed</span><span>=</span><span>TRUE</span></span><span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(204,204,204)\">)</span><br><br></span></code></pre>\n\n<p>I also contacted the author to fix this in the next update of the <code>plotGoogleMaps</code> package.\nNote that the legend does not function, but that seems to be <a href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/questions/24066461/png-legend-of-plotgooglemaps-not-displayed-in-r-shiny-app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://stackoverflow.com/questions/24066461/png-legend-of-plotgooglemaps-not-displayed-in-r-shiny-app&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792403470048000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3zRPu1sJpk8gxpxkVYn7js\">another issue.</a></p>\n\n    </div><br></div>"
    ]
   ]
